{
  "slug": "wrath-of-the-sea",
  "name": "Wrath of the Sea",
  "description": "As a Bonus Action, you can expend a use of your Wild Shape to manifest a 5-foot Emanation that takes the form of ocean waves. The Emanation lasts for 10 minutes or until you end it on a later turn. When you manifest it and at the start of each of your subsequent turns, you can choose one creature you can see in the Emanation. The target must make a Constitution saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failed save, the target takes Cold damage equal to a number of d6s equal to your Wisdom modifier and is pushed up to 15 feet straight away from you. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage only.",
